## 4 pillars
-abstraction
    Hide complex details and show only necessary features.

-encapsulation
   Data  or functions को एक object/class के अंदर सुरक्षित रखना।


-inheritance
(child class → get parents class property)


-polumorphism
one/same  function → different output


| Concept           | Meaning                           | Example                   |
| ----------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------- |
| **Abstraction**   | Complexity छुपाना                   | Car key + engine hidden  |
| **Encapsulation** | Data सुरक्षित करना                   | private variables         |
| **Inheritance**   | दूसरे class की चीज़ें मिलना            | Student → Person          |
| **Polymorphism**  | Same function, different behavior | Dog.sound() / Cat.sound() |
